/S /P
/E (Decoherence is the process in which a system in a quantum state collapses into a non-quantum state, allowing quantum computers to provide measurements and interact with classical computers. It happens when a quantum system is measured or affected by other environmental factors \(sometimes unintentionally\).)
/Alt ()
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [2]
>>
