/S /H2
/T (What I get from that, is that the field that we end up in, is strongly morphed by the situations that we are in, and the people we meet along the way who may influence us, right? How important is it to keep an open mind in research?)
/E (What I get from that, is that the field that we end up in, is strongly morphed by the situations that we are in, and the people we meet along the way who may influence us, right? How important is it to keep an open mind in research?)
