/T (The discussion turned to the role of theorists in the field. While theoretical foundations are crucial, the current emphasis is on building functional devices. The professor pointed out, "It's an applied subject. It's not about the theoretical exercise." He contrasts quantum computing with mathematics, where the goal is not just deriving theorems but creating something practical.)
/E (The discussion turned to the role of theorists in the field. While theoretical foundations are crucial, the current emphasis is on building functional devices. The professor pointed out, "It's an applied subject. It's not about the theoretical exercise." He contrasts quantum computing with mathematics, where the goal is not just deriving theorems but creating something practical.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 57 0 R
/K [6]
>>
